</section> <section class="ph-services">   <div class="ph-wrap">     <div class="ph-service-block ph-split">       <div>         <h2 class="ph-h3">Botanical Curation</h2>         <p class="ph-copy">Selected for more than species and size. Every selection is considered in relation to architectural character, spatial scale, user experience, climate suitability and long-term planting performance.</p>         <p class="ph-copy">Specimen-focused expertise covers mature trees, palms and architectural plants — from individual statement pieces to large planting programmes.</p>       </div>       <div class="ph-photo" data-ph-page-photo role="img" aria-label="Botanical curation"></div>     </div>     <div class="ph-cards">       <article class="ph-card">         <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-page-photo role="img" aria-label="Grow to Order"></div>         <div class="ph-card-body">           <h3 class="ph-h3">Grow to Order</h3>           <p class="ph-copy">Bespoke sourcing and grow-to-order programmes for project-specific botanical requirements, managed from Abu Dhabi.</p>           <a class="ph-btn" href="/contact">Learn more</a>         </div>       </article>       <article class="ph-card">         <div class="ph-card-photo" data-ph-page-photo role="img" aria-label="Specimen Documentation"></div>         <div class="ph-card-body">           <h3 class="ph-h3">Specimen Documentation</h3>           <p class="ph-copy">Every tree has an identity: specimen code, botanical and common name, origin, height, trunk dimensions and availability status.</p>           <a class="ph-btn" href="/contact">Learn more</a>         </div>       </article>     </div>     <div class="ph-editor-photos" data-ph-page-content>{{ page.content }}</div>   </div> </section> 